● | credit risk and risks from concentrations (by type of borrower, geographic area, collateral and industry) within the Company’s loan portfolio or large loans to certain borrowers (including CRE loans);

● | the overall health of the local and national real estate market;

● | business and economic conditions generally and in the financial services industry, nationally and within our market area, including the level and impact of interest rates on inflation and possible recession;

● | the ability to successfully manage credit risk; and

● | the ability to maintain an adequate level of allowance for credit losses on loans and leases.

